 class=\"phase-desc\"\u003eAccounting handles all Paychex enrollment and payroll configuration after Ethan completes IT provisioning. Brandon is not involved in this phase.\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"owner-block\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"owner-label\"\u003ePhase Owner\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"owner-name\"\u003eAccounting Team\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"owner-sub\"\u003eTriggered after Phase 4 completion\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"right-panel\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"section-label\"\u003eAccounting Actions — Paychex Enrollment\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"steps-grid\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-cell\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-num\"\u003eStep 01\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-heading\"\u003ePaychex Account Creation\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-body\"\u003eAccounting creates the new hire's Paychex employee profile using their personal information from the submitted Employment Application.\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-cell\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-num\"\u003eStep 02\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-heading\"\u003eDirect Deposit Enrollment\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-body\"\u003eBank account details from the submitted Direct Deposit Authorization form are entered into Paychex and verified for the first payroll cycle.\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-cell\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-num\"\u003eStep 03\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-heading\"\u003eTax Withholding Entry\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-body\"\u003eW-4 (federal) and NY IT-2104 (state) elections are entered into Paychex exactly as submitted by the new hire in the onboarding portal.\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-cell\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-num\"\u003eStep 04\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-heading\"\u003ePayroll Schedule \u0026amp; Benefits\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-body\"\u003ePayroll schedule confirmed and communicated to the new hire. Benefits enrollment initiated if applicable. First paycheck date confirmed.\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"trigger-bar\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"trigger-icon\"\u003e🔗\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"trigger-text\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTrigger:\u003c/span\u003e Accounting is notified automatically once Ethan marks IT Credential Provisioning complete in Phase 4. All required form data is already in the system.\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bottom-footer\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"footer-text\"\u003eAPARTMENTCORP \u0026nbsp;|\u0026nbsp; NEW HIRE ONBOARDING PROCESS \u0026nbsp;|\u0026nbsp; INTERNAL USE ONLY\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720},{"id":"phase6","path":"/home/ubuntu/apartmentcorp-onboarding-slides/phase6.html","changed":true,"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n  \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n  \u003cstyle\u003e\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .slide-container {\n      width: 1280px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: #F8F9FA;\n      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .top-bar { width: 100%; height: 6px; background: #00A86B; }\n    .he