 All\" and \"Reject All\" buttons allow Brandon to process all pending forms for a selected new hire in a single click — with confirmation prompt before execution.\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"right-col\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"col-label\"\u003eStatus Badge System\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003ctable class=\"status-table\"\u003e\n          \u003cthead\u003e\n            \u003ctr\u003e\n              \u003cth\u003eBadge\u003c/th\u003e\n              \u003cth\u003eStatus\u003c/th\u003e\n              \u003cth\u003eMeaning\u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003c/tr\u003e\n          \u003c/thead\u003e\n          \u003ctbody\u003e\n            \u003ctr\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"status-badge badge-green\"\u003eApproved\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGreen\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003eForm reviewed and accepted by HR. Card border turns green.\u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003c/tr\u003e\n            \u003ctr\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"status-badge badge-blue\"\u003eSubmitted\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlue\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003eForm submitted by new hire — awaiting HR review.\u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003c/tr\u003e\n            \u003ctr\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"status-badge badge-red\"\u003eRejected\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRed\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n              \u003ctd\u003eForm returned to new hire for correction and resubmission.\u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003c/tr\u003e\n          \u003c/tbody\u003e\n        \u003c/table\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"doc-categories\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"doc-cat-label\"\u003eDocument Categories\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003