their journey.\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"company-name\"\u003eApartmentCorp \u0026nbsp;·\u0026nbsp; Internal Use Only\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"right-accent\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"phases-strip\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e01\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eIntake\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e02\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eForms\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e03\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eApproval Chain\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e04\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eIT Provisioning\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e05\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003ePayroll Setup\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e06\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eTraining\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e07\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eDocument Hub\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e08\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eDay 1 Orientation\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e09\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eComplete\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"pill-divider\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"phase-pill\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-num\"\u003e10\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"pill-name\"\u003eArchiving\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","note":"","width":1280,"height":720}],"outline":[{"id":"title","title":"Title","summary":"ApartmentCorp New Hire Onboarding Process — A Step-by-Step Guide to Welcoming \u0026 Integrating New Team Members. Confidential internal use."},{"id":"why_structured","title":"Why a Structured Onboarding Process Matters","summary":"A consistent onboarding process sets every new hire up for success. Covers retention, productivity, the 10-phase system, and the 3-hour automated alert."},{"id":"overview","title":"The Complete Onboarding Overview","summary":"Horizontal timeline of all 10 phases with key people listed: Brandon, Regional Manager, Robert, Ethan, Nicole (COO), Marc, Accounting, New Hire."},{"id":"phase1","title":"Phase 1: Candidate Intake \u0026 Registration","summary":"Brandon sends portal invite. New hire registers with 4-digit PIN. Welcome email triggered. Ethan and Brandon notified on first login. 3-hour alert if overdue."},{"id":"phase2","title":"Phase 2: Application Forms","summary":"Nine required forms completed digitally: Employment Application, W-4, NY IT-2104, I-9, Direct Deposit, Confidentiality Agreement, GPS Agreement, Handbook Acknowledgment, Maintenance Assessment."},{"id":"phase3","title":"Phase 3: The Approval Chain","summary":"Six-level sequential approval: Brandon → Regional Manager → Robert → Ethan → Nicole (COO) → Marc. Each approver notified by email. Rejection loops back to new hire."},{"id":"phase4","title":"Phase 4: IT Credential Provisioning","summary":"Ethan provisions all 12 platforms. Progress bar per new hire card. Password-protected PDF of credentials emailed to new hire (PIN as password) and CC'd to Brandon."},{"id":"phase5","title":"Phase 5: Payroll \u0026 Accounting Setup","summary":"Accounting handles all Paychex enrollment after IT provisioning. Direct deposit linked, payroll schedule confirmed, W-4 and IT-2104 entered, benefits initiated."},{"id":"phase6","title":"Phase 6: Training Videos","summary":"New hire completes training for all 7 platforms: PropertyMAX.ai, OneSite, Connecteam, MyLoneWorkers, Yardi, ConnectUC, SamePage. Completion tracked with timestamps."},{"id":"phase7","title":"Phase 7: Document Hub \u0026 Records Review","summary":"Brandon reviews all submitted forms in Document Hub. New hire selector dropdown. Color-coded status badges. Bulk approve/reject. Manual file upload supported."},{"id":"phase8","title":"Phase 8: Day 1 Onsite Orientation","summary":"Regional Manager and New Hire complete Day 1 checklist: property tour, team introductions, keys/access issued, emergency procedures, first week schedule."},{"id":"phase9","title":"Phase 9: Onboarding Complete","summary":"Brandon and Marc final sign-off. Completion email to new hire. 3-hour automated alert to Brandon if not completed in time. All approvers notified."},{"id":"phase10","title":"Phase 10: Server File Archiving","summary":"All files filed on service server: Source → Server → Core Data → New Hire Onboarding Folders. Includes all forms, PDFs, approvals, and training records."},{